  "label": "User projected onto the scene of aiming out the window",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual scene of the person aiming a rifle out of the window, as the text 'when the new call of duty comes out and you're already camping' uses 'you' to directly address the viewer, implying the user is the gamer who is already 'camping' in anticipation of the new game release. The visual of aiming the weapon is mapped to the user's mental state of readiness and immersion in gaming culture.",
